# Written by the skills-discovery check; also appears when running it by hand
discovery.log

# The site app. Its dependencies, its build cache, and its export output — the pages are
# built on deploy, never committed. web/package-lock.json IS committed: npm ci needs it,
# and setup-node's cache key is derived from it.
web/node_modules/
web/.next/
web/out/
web/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo

# Written by `next dev` on every run (next/dist/server/lib/generate-agent-files.js). Its
# subject is the Next.js version, not this repository, and AGENTS.md at the root is the
# governing document here — a second generated pair under web/ would only compete with it.
web/AGENTS.md
web/CLAUDE.md
